              "help": {
                "text": "When doing SSH-based transfers using either SCP or SFTP, and setting the known_hosts file, libcurl could still mistakenly accept connecting to hosts *not present* in the specified file if they were added as recognized in the libssh *global* known_hosts file.\n",
                "markdown": "> When doing SSH-based transfers using either SCP or SFTP, and setting the known_hosts file, libcurl could still mistakenly accept connecting to hosts *not present* in the specified file if they were added as recognized in the libssh *global* known_hosts file.\n\n|                                                                                                       |\n|Package         pkg:deb/ubuntu/curl@7.81.0-1ubuntu1.3?os_distro=jammy&os_name=ubuntu&os_version=22.04  |\n|Affected range  <7.81.0-1ubuntu1.22                                                                    |\n|Fixed version   7.81.0-1ubuntu1.22                                                                     |\n"
              },
