              "help": {
                "text": "When curl is used to retrieve and parse cookies from a HTTP(S) server, itaccepts cookies using control codes that when later are sent back to a HTTPserver might make the server return 400 responses. Effectively allowing a\"sister site\" to deny service to all siblings.\n",
