              "help": {
                "text": "nscd: Stack-based buffer overflow in netgroup cache  If the Name Service Cache Daemon's (nscd) fixed size cache is exhausted by client requests then a subsequent client request for netgroup data may result in a stack-based buffer overflow.  This flaw was introduced in glibc 2.15 when the cache was added to nscd.  This vulnerability is only present in the nscd binary.\n",
