            {
              "id": "CVE-2022-3821",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2022-3821"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2022-3821?s=ubuntu&n=systemd&ns=ubuntu&t=deb&osn=ubuntu&osv=22.04&vr=%3C249.11-0ubuntu3.7",
              "help": {
                "text": "An off-by-one Error issue was discovered in Systemd in format_timespan() function of time-util.c. An attacker could supply specific values for time and accuracy that leads to buffer overrun in format_timespan(), leading to a Denial of Service.\n",
