            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-5981",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-5981"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2023-5981?s=ubuntu&n=gnutls28&ns=ubuntu&t=deb&osn=ubuntu&osv=22.04&vr=%3C3.7.3-4ubuntu1.3",
              "help": {
                "text": "A vulnerability was found that the response times to malformed ciphertexts in RSA-PSK ClientKeyExchange differ from response times of ciphertexts with correct PKCS#1 v1.5 padding.\n",
                "markdown": "> A vulnerability was found that the response times to malformed ciphertexts in RSA-PSK ClientKeyExchange differ from response times of ciphertexts with correct PKCS#1 v1.5 padding.\n\n|                                                                                                                                                                       |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:deb/ubuntu/gnutls28@3.7.3-4ubuntu1?os_distro=jammy&os_name=ubuntu&os_version=22.04  |\n|Affected range                                                                 <3.7.3-4ubuntu1.3                                                                       |\n|Fixed version                                                                  3.7.3-4ubuntu1.3                                                                        |\n|[[CVSS Score 5.9] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N]]                                                                                          |\n"
