            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-2283",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-2283"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2023-2283?s=ubuntu&n=libssh&ns=ubuntu&t=deb&osn=ubuntu&osv=22.04&vr=%3C0.9.6-2ubuntu0.22.04.1",
              "help": {
                "text": "A vulnerability was found in libssh, where the authentication check of the connecting client can be bypassed in the`pki_verify_data_signature` function in memory allocation problems. This issue may happen if there is insufficient memory or the memory usage is limited. The problem is caused by the return value `rc,` which is initialized to SSH_ERROR and later rewritten to save the return value of the function call `pki_key_check_hash_compatible.` The value of the variable is not changed between this point and the cryptographic verification. Therefore any error between them calls `goto error` returning SSH_OK.\n",
                "markdown": "> A vulnerability was found in libssh, where the authentication check of the connecting client can be bypassed in the`pki_verify_data_signature` function in memory allocation problems. This issue may happen if there is insufficient memory or the memory usage is limited. The problem is caused by the return value `rc,` which is initialized to SSH_ERROR and later rewritten to save the return value of the function call `pki_key_check_hash_compatible.` The value of the variable is not changed between this point and the cryptographic verification. Therefore any error between them calls `goto error` returning SSH_OK.\n\n|                                                                                                                                                                    |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:deb/ubuntu/libssh@0.9.6-2build1?os_distro=jammy&os_name=ubuntu&os_version=22.04  |\n|Affected range                                                                 <0.9.6-2ubuntu0.22.04.1                                                              |\n|Fixed version                                                                  0.9.6-2ubuntu0.22.04.1                                                               |\n|[[CVSS Score 6.5] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N]]                                                                                       |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
