              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2023-2728?s=github&n=kubernetes&ns=k8s.io&t=golang&vr=%3C1.24.15",
              "help": {
                "text": "Users may be able to launch containers that bypass the mountable secrets policy enforced by the ServiceAccount admission plugin when using ephemeral containers. The policy ensures pods running with a service account may only reference secrets specified in the service account’s secrets field. Kubernetes clusters are only affected if the ServiceAccount admission plugin and the `kubernetes.io/enforce-mountable-secrets` annotation are used together with ephemeral containers.\n",
                "markdown": "> Users may be able to launch containers that bypass the mountable secrets policy enforced by the ServiceAccount admission plugin when using ephemeral containers. The policy ensures pods running with a service account may only reference secrets specified in the service account’s secrets field. Kubernetes clusters are only affected if the ServiceAccount admission plugin and the `kubernetes.io/enforce-mountable-secrets` annotation are used together with ephemeral containers.\n\n|                                                                                                                    |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:golang/k8s.io/kubernetes@1.23.1  |\n|Affected range                                                                 <1.24.15                             |\n|Fixed version                                                                  1.24.15                              |\n|[[CVSS Score 6.5] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N]]                                       |\n"
