            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-36054",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-36054"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2023-36054?s=ubuntu&n=krb5&ns=ubuntu&t=deb&osn=ubuntu&osv=22.04&vr=%3C1.19.2-2ubuntu0.3",
              "help": {
                "text": "lib/kadm5/kadm_rpc_xdr.c in MIT Kerberos 5 (aka krb5) before 1.20.2 and 1.21.x before 1.21.1 frees an uninitialized pointer. A remote authenticated user can trigger a kadmind crash. This occurs because _xdr_kadm5_principal_ent_rec does not validate the relationship between n_key_data and the key_data array count.\n",
                "markdown": "> lib/kadm5/kadm_rpc_xdr.c in MIT Kerberos 5 (aka krb5) before 1.20.2 and 1.21.x before 1.21.1 frees an uninitialized pointer. A remote authenticated user can trigger a kadmind crash. This occurs because _xdr_kadm5_principal_ent_rec does not validate the relationship between n_key_data and the key_data array count.\n\n|                                                                                                                                                             |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:deb/ubuntu/krb5@1.19.2-2?os_distro=jammy&os_name=ubuntu&os_version=22.04  |\n|Affected range                                                                 <1.19.2-2ubuntu0.3                                                            |\n|Fixed version                                                                  1.19.2-2ubuntu0.3                                                             |\n|[[CVSS Score 6.5] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H]]                                                                                |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<1.19.2-2ubuntu0.3",
                "cvssV3": 6.5,
                "cvssV3_severity": "MEDIUM",
                "cvssV3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H",
                "fixed_version": "1.19.2-2ubuntu0.3",
                "purls": [
