              "id": "CVE-2023-52425",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-52425"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2023-52425?s=ubuntu&n=expat&ns=ubuntu&t=deb&osn=ubuntu&osv=22.04&vr=%3C2.4.7-1ubuntu0.3",
              "help": {
                "text": "libexpat through 2.5.0 allows a denial of service (resource consumption) because many full reparsings are required in the case of a large token for which multiple buffer fills are needed.\n",
