                ],
                "security-severity": "8.8",
                "tags": [
                  "MEDIUM"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2022-42898",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2022-42898"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2022-42898?s=ubuntu&n=krb5&ns=ubuntu&t=deb&osn=ubuntu&osv=22.04&vr=%3C1.19.2-2ubuntu0.1",
              "help": {
                "text": "PAC parsing in MIT Kerberos 5 (aka krb5) before 1.19.4 and 1.20.x before 1.20.1 has integer overflows that may lead to remote code execution (in KDC, kadmind, or a GSS or Kerberos application server) on 32-bit platforms (which have a resultant heap-based buffer overflow), and cause a denial of service on other platforms. This occurs in krb5_pac_parse in lib/krb5/krb/pac.c. Heimdal before 7.7.1 has \"a similar bug.\"\n",
                "markdown": "> PAC parsing in MIT Kerberos 5 (aka krb5) before 1.19.4 and 1.20.x before 1.20.1 has integer overflows that may lead to remote code execution (in KDC, kadmind, or a GSS or Kerberos application server) on 32-bit platforms (which have a resultant heap-based buffer overflow), and cause a denial of service on other platforms. This occurs in krb5_pac_parse in lib/krb5/krb/pac.c. Heimdal before 7.7.1 has \"a similar bug.\"\n\n|                                                                                                                                                             |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:deb/ubuntu/krb5@1.19.2-2?os_distro=jammy&os_name=ubuntu&os_version=22.04  |\n|Affected range                                                                 <1.19.2-2ubuntu0.1                                                            |\n|Fixed version                                                                  1.19.2-2ubuntu0.1                                                             |\n|[[CVSS Score 8.8] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H]]                                                                                |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<1.19.2-2ubuntu0.1",
                "cvssV3": 8.8,
                "cvssV3_severity": "MEDIUM",
                "cvssV3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H",
