              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-68973?s=ubuntu&n=gnupg2&ns=ubuntu&t=deb&osn=ubuntu&osv=22.04&vr=%3C2.2.27-3ubuntu2.5",
              "help": {
                "text": "In GnuPG before 2.4.9, armor_filter in g10/armor.c has two increments of an index variable where one is intended, leading to an out-of-bounds write for crafted input. (For ExtendedLTS, 2.2.51 and later are fixed versions.)\n",
