            {
              "id": "CVE-2021-41771",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2021-41771"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2021-41771?s=golang&n=stdlib&t=golang&vr=%3C1.16.10",
              "help": {
                "text": "Calling File.ImportedSymbols on a loaded file which contains an invalid dynamic symbol table command can cause a panic, in particular if the encoded number of undefined symbols is larger than the number of symbols in the symbol table.\n",
                "markdown": "> Calling File.ImportedSymbols on a loaded file which contains an invalid dynamic symbol table command can cause a panic, in particular if the encoded number of undefined symbols is larger than the number of symbols in the symbol table.\n\n|                                          |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.16.5  |\n|Affected range  <1.16.10                  |\n|Fixed version   1.16.10                   |\n"
              },
