              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2022-41723?s=golang&n=stdlib&t=golang&vr=%3C1.19.6",
              "help": {
                "text": "A maliciously crafted HTTP/2 stream could cause excessive CPU consumption in the HPACK decoder, sufficient to cause a denial of service from a small number of small requests.\n",
                "markdown": "> A maliciously crafted HTTP/2 stream could cause excessive CPU consumption in the HPACK decoder, sufficient to cause a denial of service from a small number of small requests.\n\n|                                          |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.16.5  |\n|Affected range  <1.19.6                   |\n|Fixed version   1.19.6                    |\n"
              },
