              "help": {
                "text": "The processing time for parsing some invalid inputs scales non-linearly with respect to the size of the input.\n\nThis affects programs which parse untrusted PEM inputs.\n",
                "markdown": "> The processing time for parsing some invalid inputs scales non-linearly with respect to the size of the input.\n\nThis affects programs which parse untrusted PEM inputs.\n\n|                                        |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.17  |\n|Affected range  <1.24.8                 |\n|Fixed version   1.24.8                  |\n"
